          "quote": "these cracks do not cross the coarsened α2-Ti3Al grain, leaving crack-bridging (Figs. 5(d) and (e)). The crack deflection and crack-bridging formation will consume more fraction energy, being beneficial to improving strength and ductility of the alloys.",
